OL,3,GNEWSAPoor harvest and rising costs for
OL,4,Aapple farmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FApple growers say this year's
OL,7,Fexceptionally hot weather has left them
OL,8,Ffacing significantly smaller harvests
OL,9,Fand rising costs.
OL,11,FIn Shelsey, near Worcester, grower
OL,12,FJames Holloway expects production to
OL,13,Ffall sharply, despite harvesting a
OL,14,Fsimilar area of orchards to last year.
OL,16,F"We get paid by the tonne, so it's
OL,17,Fgoing to have a big impact on our
OL,18,Fbusiness this year," he said.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
