OL,3,GNEWSAPoor harvest and rising costs for
OL,4,Aapple farmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolloway, whose business manages 230
OL,7,Facres (93 hectares) of orchards, said
OL,8,Fthe main problem this year had been the
OL,9,Fsize of the fruit.
